<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Misé</para>
  <para style="toc1">Misé Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Misé</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mis</para>
  <para style="mt1">Misé</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Misé ná-GALA gooiti ka ti sɛʋɛi nii zu. Misé ɠɛni ga Zuda laa wolai ta zu nu, taai naa laaseigi ɠɛni ga Molesɛte (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 1:1">1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:18">Zel 26:18</ref></char>). Misé ɠɛni GALA gooi wosu Zuda masagi niiti ta-ziɛgiti su: Yotame, Aɠaze, ta Ezekiase. Naa ɠa é bosu ga ná-botii ma yeeɠɛɠalai ɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu kona undɔfela puulɔɔlugɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta undɔfelai (750-700), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ. Naama yeeɠɛɠalai maaɓuɠaʋɛ Ezayi ta Wozé ta-ƓALA goo wo siɛgiti ba. Nu la kwɛɛ ni Misé ɓɔɠɔgo ɠa é ná-GALA gooiti sɛʋɛai, ɓaa ná-kaladopoi ta ɠa é ti zɛʋɛai. GALA goo wo nui Zelemi laaʋilɛgɛ Misé Ná-Sɛʋɛi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 26:18">Zel 26:18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Misé ná-GALA gooiti ta ɓɔɛzu é lo GALA ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋeiti ba ta ná-kizo fai. Misé ɠa Izilayɛle ta Zuda ʋeelalazu ga ta bala nuiti maanɔɠɔzu, naa ʋoluma ta ga wali wɔin nu wolaiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 2:2">2:2</ref></char>). É ta-ƓALA goo wo nuiti ɓalaa peelala tɔɔzei ta ga lobɛanii zo nuiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 3:5">3:5</ref></char>). É ɠɛ ti ma GALA ka ʋaazu ta-laa wolaiti koloɠolosu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 1:6">1:6</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:12">3:12</ref></char>), ta toɠa ʋaazu liizu mɔunpa ga Izilayɛle nuiti duɔlai zu, naa ʋoluma Zuda geleiti ɓalaa. Kɛlɛ GALA ka ʋaazu ɠitoozu ná-minazeɠegi zu, é ɠaaɠale ma ga kidaaleʋe nu goa nɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 4:6">4:6</ref></char>). GALA ge minazeɠeni ɓalaa ga toɠa totuɠɔ leʋe, nii a ɠɛ ga Ɓɛteleyɛme nu, Mesi, nii é ʋaazu masadai ɠɛɛzu Izilayɛle unda ta eteai pɛ unda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 5:2-4">5:2-4</ref></char>). Misé Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ ga kitoosui é lo GALA ná-minazeɠegi ʋa Abalaame ta Zakɔɓe ʋɛ. GALA ná-nɛɛbɛi ta ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ta vɔni ná-ziiɠaawanai ma.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ada mɔungi togai tukpɔɠaaleʋei ta unmɔɔgi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 1:1-2:13">1:1—2:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ada velesiɛi togai tukpɔɠaaleʋei ta unmɔɔgi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 3:1-5:14">3:1—5:14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ada zaʋasiɛi togai tukpɔɠaaleʋei ta unmɔɔgi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 6:1-7:20">6:1—7:20</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1"/>Wooiti ka ga niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti laazeelini Molesɛte nui Misé ma, Zuda masa saʋagɔiti ta-yeeɠɛɠalaiti, Yotame, ta Aɠaze ta Ezekiase. Kulakɛlɛmai naati ti ʋilɛni taa wolaiti ba, ti ga, Samali ta Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="MIC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋeai Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2"/>Nuɓusɛiti pɛ à woilo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">Zooi ta wɔiti wo zooi ɠa, à ɠida bu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa yɛsu seizu ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:2">é zeele wooi wo wo laalɔɠɔma!<verse eid="MIC 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3"/>Wɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠana ɠula seizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:3">é yei, é ɗa ɠɔɠɔziɛ zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti su.<verse eid="MIC 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4"/>Gizeiti ti ɗa ɓusɛ kɔɠɔwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">pɛtugiti sulaa ɗa lao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">eɠɛ kedoi ɠaa ɠa ɠɛ wuunsu abui ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:4">eɠɛ ziɛ a ɠɛ gizei yeizu.<verse eid="MIC 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5"/>Naa pɛ ka ga Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti ta-lɔ koloɠologi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ná-kotoi maaʋele ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Ɓɛ ɠa é Zakɔɓe liizu tɔ koloɠologi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Ná-taa wolai Samali laade ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Ɓɛ ɠa é Zuda liizu ani ɠɔɔ vaiti ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:5">Zeluzalɛme laade ɓaa?<verse eid="MIC 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Naa ma, nà Samali ɠɛɛzu ga kɔtu ziɠigi dɔɓɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">ti ɗa leezɛn ɓelei la ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">nà ná-kɔtuiti kilikili, ti la nɛmɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:6">gè kpale ná, ma wuulaagiti ti maaɠala.<verse eid="MIC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7"/>Ná-kɔɔɠɔ gani kpɛtɛaiti su ɠa ɠaleɠale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">ná-tɔnɔ ɲɔiti pɛ ti ɠala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">Ná-vololiba zaɠaaiti, gè naati suɓulukpulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">tɔɔzei naati ti ɓɛtɛni ga ná-koloɠologi ma ɠulanumai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:7">ta ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga koloɠologi taɠiligaa ma ɠulanumai.»<verse eid="MIC 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui ná-gɔlɔi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛzu gè ɠaalɛizu, gè ɗa wɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">gè ɗa ziɛ ga ɠɔɠɔa ɲakai, kɔ̀ba ɲakai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">gè ɗa kpeei loo eɠɛ koʋei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:8">gè ɗa kpalagi wo eɠɛ saa wɔnigi.<verse eid="MIC 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ maanɔɠɔi seeliai Samali ma, é la ɠulaa su pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">É zeelia Zuda yooi ma ta Zeluzalɛme taa ziɠidaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:9">ʋɛ nà-nuɓusɛiti ti zeini ná.<verse eid="MIC 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1:10-15 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Puuzui niiti su, GALA goo wo nui ɠa taaiti daaseigiti ta pɛɛ ungi lɛɛzu. Naama ʋoogi ta ɠa ga: Ɓɛte-Leafala ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga «fufili pɛlɛi». Naa ɠa é kɛa, Eɓulu wooi zu, puuzu 10 ɠaaɓelasuʋɛ ɠɛ ma: «Fufili pɛlɛi wu nuiti, à ɠilikili fufiligi zu».</char>
    </note>À mina daazeeli Gate taazuʋɛ, à mina wɔlɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:10">Ɓɛte-Leafala nuiti, à ɠilikili fufiligi zu!<verse eid="MIC 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11"/>Safiil nuiti, à leʋe ga ɠɔba ɲakai ta wa-unfegi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Saanan nuiti ti la zoosu ti ʋa ɠula taa ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">Gɔlɔi ɠa wosu Ɓɛte-Ɠayɛsɛle taazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:11">kpɔba zobo ge la mɔ ná.<verse eid="MIC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12"/>Malote taaʋeaiti sasu ɠa ɓalizu ta-ɠulanumaiti ma vaa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">Mazɔlɔɔ nimiza vai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI teʋegai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:12">é zeelia Zeluzalɛme taa ziɠidaʋɛ ma.<verse eid="MIC 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13"/>Lakise laaʋeaiti, à wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti ta sooiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">Wo ʋokɔɠɔni Izilayɛle ná-wooʋaladai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:13">wo Zeluzalɛme lɔ tɔ koloɠologiti su.<verse eid="MIC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14"/>Naa ma, Zuda nuɓusɛiti à bali ma wa Molesɛte-Gate nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:14">Akiziɓe taa wolai la ɠɛa ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:14">kula faa zu ani Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta-masagiti bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15"/>Maliɠii ɠa wo lɔɔzu nu niinɛ yeezu Malesa nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ti lɔɠɔɠulaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:15">ta ʋelazuʋɛ ɠaiziɛ Adulame ʋugi zu.<verse eid="MIC 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16"/>À wɔungiti bo, wo ti ɓuye ma, Zeluzalɛme taaʋeaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">kpaanagi ɠɛ wo-unmaʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗuai nɔungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">à wo yiima lointi ta-wɔlɔi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 1:16">mazɔlɔɔ ta liizu ga tiye duɔlai zu, ti maaɠooza wo ʋa.<verse eid="MIC 1:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2"/>
  <para style="s">Tooma nuiti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1"/>Maanɔɠɔ ɠa naati tuɠɔ, niiti ti telebotala vai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">ti ɗa ɠisiɛ faa ɲɔi zu, ta ɠɛna laani kpidii!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">Geelaa a laona, ti ʋilɛ kɛɛ vai ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:1">siɛgi zu ma zobogi ti ʋɛ la.<verse eid="MIC 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2"/>Ti ɗa ɠaazuɠula kpalagiti ba, ti ɗa ti zeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">ta pɛlɛiti, ti ɗa ti zeɠe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">Ti ɗa loo nuiti ma, ti ɗa ta-ʋɛlɛ wu zɔɔlaiti seɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:2">ti ɗa ta-yooiti kula ti ya.<verse eid="MIC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">«Nà maanɔɠɔi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu niima nu ziiti daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">wo la zooga wo ʋa ɠɔgi ɠula bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">wa ɠɛna ziaa, kɛni wo wɔungi ʋilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:3">mazɔlɔɔ yeeɠɛɠalai é ʋaazu toɠa ga nimiza ziɛgi.»<verse eid="MIC 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4"/>Naama volo ná, ta wo laalɔ guyei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">ti ɗa maawɔin wuyei loo wo ma ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">«Giya ɠa gi ɠoloɠologai mɛtu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Gá-nuɓusɛiti ti ʋalaga ta-yooiti ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Zɔiti ta gi ɓɛɛzu gá-ɓalagaʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">ti ɗa ti ɠaaɠwɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:4">Leeni vaa zu ti loozu gi ma?»<verse eid="MIC 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5"/>Tama, wo tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ nɔnɔ zɔlɔɔga zooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:5">nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti ti gaaɠwɛɛzu.<verse eid="MIC 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔiti ti GALA goo wo nui wooi zakpesu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6"/>Ta zɛɛ ɓɔɛi wosu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">«À mina zɛɛ ɓɔɛi wo fuun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">Nu mina zɛɛ ɓɔɛi wo ga naama zii ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:6">Ɓaaɠulama vai la zeɠea ma!<verse eid="MIC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, leeni ɠa é wosu Zakɔɓe ná-nuɓusɛiti saama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawana fala ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">Ná-faa ɠɛʋele ɠa nɛi ɓaa?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">GALA ge ɠɛ ma: «Dàawooiti ti la zolooni ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:7">naama nui ʋɛ, nii é telebodai ɠɛɛzu ɓaa?<verse eid="MIC 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8"/>Kɛlɛ wogi mɔnɔ, wo nà-nuɓusɛiti kɛɛni ga wo zili nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">Wa seɠe wolai ɠulazu seɠewuzeɠeiti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:8">naati kɔba ti leʋesu wo ɠoba ziilɛigi zu, ti ɗa zeɠe kɔɔmaʋɛ.<verse eid="MIC 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9"/>Wa nà-nuɓusɛiti ti-anzaiti kpɛɛzu ti zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">wo ti ɠula ti yiima ʋɛlɛiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">lɛbiya ʋoganii gè feai ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:9">wa naa ɠulazu ti ya, ti la sɔlɔɔga pɛ.<verse eid="MIC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10"/>À wuzeɠe! À liina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">Mazɔlɔɔ niima yooi la ga dooɠo bosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:10">tɔɔzei ná-kɔzɔi maaʋele ma, toɠa ʋaazu ɠoloɠolosu ga gola.<verse eid="MIC 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11"/>Nui ta a ʋaana, é ɗa kpizɛ ɲakai wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">é ɗa zɛɛ ɓɔɛiti bo ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">‹Nà bosu wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">wa ʋaazu dɔɔi zɔlɔɔsu ta gaazulati ganiiti.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:11">Zɛɛ ɓɔɛ wo nui naa ɠa soloogai niima nuɓusɛiti ma!»<verse eid="MIC 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ka Izilayɛle nu vului mɔtaiti gaalɛ ba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12"/>«Nà ʋaazu wo pɛ wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba, Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">nà ʋaazu wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba, Izilayɛle nu vului mɔtaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">nà wo ɠaalɛ ba, eɠɛ baalagiti ti sasa ɠilagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">eɠɛ baala kpulugiti ti laamiizu ada ɠila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:12">Nu ɠa ɠɛ bɛbɛ wolai zɔngɔ wooi mɛnisu.»<verse eid="MIC 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13"/>Zɔi é pelei ɠulazu, naa ɠa lo ti luɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Ta pelei ɠula, ti ɠaaɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">ti leʋe siɠidaʋɛ, ti ɠula ga ná ʋelei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Ta-masagi ɠa lo ti luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 2:13">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa a ɠɛ ti untuɠɔ.<verse eid="MIC 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ta-lopele ɲɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1"/>Gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">«À woilo, Zakɔɓe mavofodai ma ɠundiɠiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">wɔi wo zeini Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti unda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:1">Wo-losuʋɛ la ga wo ʋa ziɛ ga sɔledai ɓaa?<verse eid="MIC 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2"/>Wa ɠɛlɛzu faa ʋagɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">faa ɲɔi ɠa nɛai wo ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">wa nuiti kɔlɔgi ɠulazu ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:2">wo ti ma zuai ɠula ti-ɠaeiti ma.»<verse eid="MIC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3"/>Ti-laamianigi ɠa nɔnɔ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti ma zuai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">Ta ti-ɠɔlɔgi ɠulazu ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">ti ti-ɠaeiti galeɠale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">Ti ti zuɓulukpulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:3">eɠɛ suai, nu gilizu kɔlu liɠii zu.<verse eid="MIC 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ta wooɠulana Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma ga é ɓɔ ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">Maliɠii la ti wooɠaaʋotega pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">kɛlɛ toɠa ʋoluave ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:4">tɔɔzei faa ɲɔi ʋa, ti kɛɛni.<verse eid="MIC 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nuiti ti Izilayɛle yaavazu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa, é ga nii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">GALA goo wo nuiti ta-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">niiti ti ná-nuɓusɛiti kakasu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">«Ni ta ani lɔɔna ti-la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">ta ɗa ɠɛ ma naazu fai pɛ ge zolooga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">kɛlɛ ta ɗa kɔɔi ʋɛɛ naati ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:5">zɔiti ti la ani lɔɔni ti-la.<verse eid="MIC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6"/>Wa ɠɛ niina kpidii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">wo la mɔ kulakɛlɛma ɠaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">Ʋelela ʋele vaiti bo fai ɓega!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">Kpidii ɠa ʋɛɛ niina wo ma, eɠɛ foloi a daana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:6">foloi zu ɠa ɓidi wo ʋɛ.»<verse eid="MIC 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7"/>Zɔiti ti faiti bosu ma yeeluɠɔ, ɓaa ɠa ɠula ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">ungaiziɛ nuiti ta unfe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">Ti pɛ ta ɠaazulɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:7">mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la ti wooɠaaʋotega pɛ.<verse eid="MIC 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, dàavegɛ ga gaaɓaai ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">ta sɔledai, ta zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">ga gè Zakɔɓe mavofodai ná-tɔ koloɠologiti dɛɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:8">ta gè Izilayɛle ná-kotoi lɛɛ la.<verse eid="MIC 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9"/>À woilo deɠɛmu nii ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">Zakɔɓe mavofodai ma ɠundiɠiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">wɔi wo zeini Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti unda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">Wa sɔle fai wɔinzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:9">wo telebodai maaʋe.<verse eid="MIC 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10"/>Wa Siyɔn losu ga nu ʋaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:10">wo Zeluzalɛme lo ga suɲɔi.<verse eid="MIC 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11"/>Ta-ɠundiɠiiti ta tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu lobɛanii maazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Kɛni ti ta-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti sala pɛ, ti ʋa nuiti kala ga tɔ gooi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Kɛni ti ta-ƓALA goo wo nuiti sala pɛ ga walii, ti ʋa ʋelela ʋele vaa wo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Ti ɗa ʋoluzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la gi zaama ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:11">Ɗa ma, maanɔɠɔ nɔpɛ ge la zeelia gi ma.»<verse eid="MIC 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, wo maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">Siyɔn ɠa woli, eɠɛ kpalagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">Zeluzalɛme ɠa ɠolo, é ɠɛ ga kɔtu ziɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 3:12">dɔɓɔi ɠa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠizei maaɓɔle.<verse eid="MIC 3:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ka masadai ɠɛ Siyɔn</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1"/>Yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagiti ta zeelina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠizei ɠaa ɠa ɠooza, é lo gizeiti pɛ maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">toɠa lo gize goiti pɛ maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:1">nuɓusɛ ʋɛbɛi ɠa ɠɛ liizu pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2"/>Zii ɠiligiti ta ɠɛ liizu ná, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">«À ʋa ade lɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">naa ɠa a kɛ, é ná-peleiti dɛɛ ga adeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">ade ʋa ziɛ ga ná-peleiti.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">Mazɔlɔɔ Siyɔn ɠa tɔgi a zeɠe ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:2">ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ɠa zɔlɔɔ Zeluzalɛme nɔ.<verse eid="MIC 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3"/>Toɠa zaamazu logi wo nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin zɔɠɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">toɠa ɠɛ ga zii wolaiti ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋe nui, anɛɛ zɔiti ti maaɠoozaai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Ta ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ woɠa zɔkpɔiti kɛ ga kaliiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">ti ta-ɓɛɛinti kɛ ga molo leʋe woɠaiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">Zii la mɔ valaa zii ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:3">nu la mɔ kɔɔɠɔ vaa ma ɠala boga.<verse eid="MIC 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4"/>Ɛsɛ ka ná-leezɛn ɓelei la ziilɛigi zu, ta ná-kooleɠoole gulu ɓelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">nu nɔpɛ ge la bɔɔla maalua mɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:4">mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, ɠa é boga.<verse eid="MIC 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5"/>Zɔɔma nuɓusɛiti ta ziɛzu ta-ɠalagiti daaseigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:5">kɛlɛ giya ma, gá yɛ ziɛzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ada-ƓALAGI laaseigi zu, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="MIC 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ná-baala kpulugi ɠaalɛ ba</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6"/>«Naama volo ná, nà nà-baalagiti gaalɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">zɔiti ti maalɛɠɛfɛgai, ta zɔiti ti zuvazagai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">niiti gè ti zopele ɲɔuni,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:6">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="MIC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7"/>«Zɔiti ti maalɛɠɛfɛgai, nà naa mɔtaiti makɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">zɔiti ti maaɠoozani, gè naati kɛ ga zii wola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛ ti unda, Siyɔn gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:7">é zo názuʋɛ ma, eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="MIC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8"/>Ɗa ʋe, Zeluzalɛme ɠizei, è wɛlɛzu nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">eɠɛ baala makɛ nui é wɛlɛ baala kpulugi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">ɗa ga ʋa ɗa-masadai zɔlɔɔsu ʋolu, nii é ɠɛni è ya mɔungi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:8">Zeluzalɛme ɠa ɠɛ ʋolu ga masadai ma laa wolai.»<verse eid="MIC 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ná-ʋoluɠulai ta unmɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9"/>Lee ɓee ɠa wo toozu niizu, niizu Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Masa ge la mɔ wo ʋɛ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">Wo lɛnɛ nui zaa ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:9">taɓai wo zosu ɠani, eɠɛ anzanu a ɠɛ doun zɔlɔɔsu?<verse eid="MIC 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10"/>Siyɔn laaʋeaiti, à ɓɔɠɔ zuɓili ga taɓai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">wo kpalagi wo, eɠɛ anzanui é doin zɔlɔɔsu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Mazɔlɔɔ wa ɠulazu taai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">wo zei dɔɓɔ wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">wa liizu, eyɛsu wo zeeli Ɓaɓilɔne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Kɛlɛ miná ɠa wa unmɔɔgi zɔlɔɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa wo ɠeya ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:10">é wo ɠula wo zili nuiti zea.<verse eid="MIC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11"/>Kɛlɛ niizuʋɛ, zii mɔinmɔin ge ɠaalɛa ba wo laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:11">ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:11">«Ɓaaɠula faan wa-laai ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:11">Ade Siyɔn taai tɛi koloɠolosuʋɛ ɠa!»<verse eid="MIC 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12"/>Kɛlɛ ti la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">ti la kisu vaiti gaaɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">ti la kwɛɛ ga é ti ɠaalɛɛʋɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:12">eɠɛ molo ɠiliiti, é ti ʋu ti-loɠazuʋɛ.<verse eid="MIC 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13"/>Siyɔn nuiti, à wuzeɠe, wo moloi loɠa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">Nà minɛi losu wo ʋa, é ga kɔlui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">gè wo-ʋolokagi ɠɛ eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">wa nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin dɛɛvɛ ɠɔɠɔwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">wa ti-yeaɠɔligi kpein kɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:13">ta-naavoloi kpein ka ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ, eteai pɛ Maliɠii.<verse eid="MIC 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 4:14"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, à wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti gaalɛ ba, Siyɔn nuiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:14">Ta ga ade zei kɛlɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 4:14">ti Izilayɛle ná-kundiɠii loɠa gaazuʋɛ ga tukpɔi.<verse eid="MIC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5"/>
  <para style="s">Masagi ɠa zɔlɔɔ Ɓɛteleyɛme</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1"/>Ɗɔun ɗa ʋe, Ɓɛteleyɛme Efelata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">ɗɛi è ga taa goi Zuda laa wolaiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">è ʋɔ bɛ ɠa nu ɠulazu ná bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">zɔi a zei Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">nii ná-fai lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ɠulaai wɔlɔwɔlɔi ma ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:1">yeeɠɛɠalaiti ti leʋegai kaite.<verse eid="MIC 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa dɛ a ɠaazuzeɠe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">eyɛsu naama yeei zeeli, yeei anzanui naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">nii maanɛai é doin zɔlɔɔ, naa sɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">Kɛɛɠɛleai mɔtaiti ti yɛsu duɔlai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:2">naati ti ʋa ʋolu, ti ʋu Izilayɛle nui zɔiti ma.<verse eid="MIC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3"/>Tɔun ka zei ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">é lo ná-baala kpulugiti tuɠɔ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zobogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maaɲiagi, nii é ga ná-GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">Ná-nuɓusɛiti ta zɛnvui wo ziilɛigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">mazɔlɔɔ ɛsɛ pɛ ka bɔɔlɔ adaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:3">eyɛsu zou ɓela ga ná pɛ.<verse eid="MIC 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4"/>Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ziilɛigi!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 5:4"/>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">Siɛgi zu Asiili nuiti ta ʋaa la, ti lɔ gá-yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">ti lɔ gá-ʋɛlɛ ʋagɔiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:4">gá totuɠɔiti ta kundiɠi mɔinmɔin teʋe ti laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="MIC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5"/>Ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti saɓui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">ta-zobogi ɠa ɠɛ Asiili yooi ma, Nimelɔde yooi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi toɠa gi ɠula Asiili nuiti zeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:5">siɛgi zu ta gá-you ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ maazuɓudɛna la, ti lɔ gá-yooi zu.<verse eid="MIC 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti zii ɠiligiti su</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ta yɛ nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">ta ɠɛ eɠɛ nɔɗa pagɔi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI teʋesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">ɓaa eɠɛ sabalagi é ʋuuzu tufai ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">zee la laani nu nɔpɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:6">ki ge la loni nuɓusɛ ʋa.<verse eid="MIC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ta yɛ ziiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">ti zu ɠa ɓaa, eɠɛ zalai é dɔɓɔ zuaiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">ɓaa eɠɛ zala ɓokpagi é toganiiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">Siɛgi zu é leʋesu da, é ɗa ɠɔɠɔlo ti ma, é ɗa ti ʋali ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:7">nu nɔpɛ ge la kulaa zea.<verse eid="MIC 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8"/>À yeeʋɛɛ wo-ɓɔɛɲɔɠɔiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:8">ta mɔnɔ wo zili nuiti pɛ ti ɠoloɠolo!<verse eid="MIC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ka ná-nuɓusɛiti ɲade</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9"/>«Naama volo ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:9">nà wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ zooiti pɛ kula zooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:9">gè wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti pɛ koloɠolo,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:9">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="MIC 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10"/>«Nà wa-yooi ma laa wolaiti pɛ koloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:10">gè ada ɓiigiti suvaza, ʋɛti wo ʋoluzeiɗai naati ba.<verse eid="MIC 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11"/>Nà zoɠo vaiti pɛ kula wo zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:11">ungaiziɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛa wo yeema.<verse eid="MIC 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12"/>Nà kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kula wo zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:12">gulu zaɠaaiti ta kɔtu ziɠigiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:12">wo la mɔ nɔkɔga ani nɔpɛ bu, nii wo kpɛtɛai ga yeei.<verse eid="MIC 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13"/>Nà wa-zale wuluiti tɔɔɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:13">gè wa-laaiti koloɠolo.<verse eid="MIC 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14"/>Nà potokulai ɠɛ zii ɠiligiti ma, ti la ɠoloni bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 5:14">ga ziiɠaawanai ta ziiɠulagi.»<verse eid="MIC 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6"/>
  <para style="s">Tukpɔi é Maliɠii ta ná-nuɓusɛiti zɔɠɔzu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1"/>À woilo deɠɛmu naa ma, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI bosu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:1">Wuzeɠe, è lukpɔ gizeiti kakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:1">gize goiti ti è-wooi mɛni!<verse eid="MIC 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2"/>À woilo, wa ʋe, gizeiti, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋeai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">wa ɓalaa zooi wu ɓɛdɛgiti ti la ɲiikpiga pɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">Mazɔlɔɔ tukpɔi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ta ná-nuɓusɛiti zɔɠɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:2">kpɔɛi ɠa ti yɔɠɔzu ta Izilayɛle nuiti.<verse eid="MIC 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3"/>Maliɠii ɠɛ ma: «Nà-nuɓusɛiti, leeni ɠa gè kɛai ga woye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">Leeni ɠa gè wo ɓɔlɔni la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:3">À gòoi ɠaaʋote dɛɛ!<verse eid="MIC 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4"/>Tɔɔzei gè wo ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa, wo ʋa ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:4">Gè wo unmɔɔni, gè wo ɠula duɔlai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:4">Gè Moize ta Aalɔn ta Miliyameni toni wo luɠɔ.<verse eid="MIC 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5"/>Nà-nuɓusɛiti, à ɠizɛ su ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">Moaɓe masagi Ɓalake faa ɲɔi leveni wo laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">wo ɠizɛ naa zu, nii Ɓeyɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalaame gooɠaaʋoteni da.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-24:25">GlS 22:1—24:25</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">Gè yɛni wo ʋa, é zo Sitime é li Gilegale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">wo kɛ̀ɛwotiiti kaani, niiti ti zɔlegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:5">nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="MIC 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI pɔ ga nuɓusɛi ɗa kɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6"/>Leeni ɠa nà li gè lo da, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">siɛgi zu gè liizu nɔkɔsu da tɔun bu, GALAGI é Anii-Pɛ-Unda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">Gala zalaɠaiti ka nà li ga tiye pɔ ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:6">ti ga kona gila nikɛ yiʋoiti?<verse eid="MIC 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa yeezei nɛi, baala sinɛ ɓulugiti bu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">Ɓaa gulɔi ma ɓoigi la eɠɛ ziɛ wolaiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">Ɓaa gè dòun mɔungi ve nà-tɔ koloɠologiti faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:7">nii a kɛ é nà-kotoiti suvaayɛ?<verse eid="MIC 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8"/>Ee, ɗa ʋe nui, ti è ɠalagɛ ga tuʋa ʋele ʋagɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">ta nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔinni ga è kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">toɠa ga è ziɛ ga sɔledai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">wooɠɛɠiladai nɛɛ è ʋɛ, è ɗa ziɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:8">è ziɛ ga pagɔ unmaayei zu, ga ɗa-ƓALAGI yiima ʋelei.<verse eid="MIC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ka yaavai ta toomai zala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɓɔɛzu taa wolai ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">ɠimalai ɠa ga nu unfe daaseigi ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">«À woilo zelii ma, é losu wo ma, wo maaɠolo vai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:9">wo woilo naa wooi ma, zɔi é devei wosu!<verse eid="MIC 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10"/>Nà zoo nɛi gè va bu ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:10">ti ta-ʋɛlɛiti buulaave ga naavoloi sɔlɔɔgai yaavai zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:10">Ta zɛɛ ɠɔɠɔ bo ganiiti, ti la kula ɠɛɛni su, naati wɔin la mà?<verse eid="MIC 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11"/>Gè la zeliloga naati ma ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:11">zɔiti ti zɛɛ ɠɔɠɔ ganiiti seɠezu ta-ɓɔlɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:11">ti ɗa nuiti yaava la?<verse eid="MIC 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12"/>Taai tɛi su naavolo nuiti ta ga tooma nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:12">taaʋeai tɛiti ta ɗa zɛɛi wo, yaava nɛgi ɠa é ti-la.<verse eid="MIC 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà wo zopele ɲɔuzu eyɛsu wo zeeɓɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:13">gè wo ɠoloɠolo wa-ɠotoiti faa zu.<verse eid="MIC 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14"/>Wa daami wo, wo la yiɠoa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">pului la zeɠea wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">Zɔi wa makɛ, naa la makɛga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">Zɔi wa ɓaa maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:14">nà naa ɠoloɠolo ga kɔɔi.<verse eid="MIC 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15"/>Wa faza, kɛlɛ wo la teʋea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:15">Wa wolive wulɔi ɓɛtɛ, wo la wo-maavaa ɠɛa ga ta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:15">wa dɔɔɓɔigi ɓɛtɛ, kɛlɛ wo la ma lɔɔi ta pa kpɔlea.<verse eid="MIC 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16"/>Wa ziɛzu ga pele ɲɔi masagi Womeli dɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">ta Akaɓe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ziɛ ʋelei ɠa wo ziɛzu la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">Naa ɠa é ba, nà ʋaazu ga wa-laai ɠoloɠolo saɓui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">Nà wo ɠɛ ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 6:16">nà-nuɓusɛiti ta-unfegi ma ɠasɔi ɠa la wo unma.»<verse eid="MIC 6:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7"/>
  <para style="s">GALA keelai wɔlɔ vai <optbreak/> nuɓusɛiti ta-yaava vai zu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1"/>Ee! Màanɔɠɔa! Gè ɠɛa ga naama nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">é ʋaazu gulu waa ɠulazuʋɛ, ti ɓega ʋoluma ga ti ɠula ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">eɠɛ zɔi é gulu waa ɠɔpɔgiti gaiziɛzu kula nuiti poluʋelei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">Kɛlɛ leezɛn ɠila kpalaa ge la ná, nu a mi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">kooleɠoole gwaa ma nɛɛnɛ gila kpalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:1">nii gòla wɔinɗai ma.<verse eid="MIC 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2"/>Wooɠɛɠila nuiti ti ɓega zooi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">sɔle nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">Nu ʋaa ɠisiɛi nɔ ɠa é ti pɛ ziimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:2">ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaaʋɛɛnɛ, ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3"/>Ti ɠeleɠelegɛ faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu, ti yee la ɠulaa su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">Kundiɠiiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta lobɛanii ɠulazu nuiti zea ga maaɓaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">nu wolaiti ti ɗa ti yiima vai wo ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:3">ti pɛ ta zoloosu faa ɠila ma.<verse eid="MIC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4"/>Zɔi pagai ti zaama, naa ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ɠaingiti ti ɠaalɛai ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">ti zaama, zɔi sɔlegai ti pɛ ba, naa ɲɔu é leʋe ɠaingi ma lɔɓɔɠɛlɛgi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 7:4"/>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Wɛlɛ, wo zala voloi ɠana ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">nii wo makɛ nuiti ti boni, GALA goo wo nuiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:4">Niizu, wa niina kiteʋei zu.<verse eid="MIC 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5"/>Mina la è-wɔɔla la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">mina ʋoluzei è-nɛɛɲɔɠɔ ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:5">Dama, è mina laalao è ɓɔɠɔ anzai ɠaazu.<verse eid="MIC 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ doun zunui ɠa kɛɛɠɛ wɔinzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">doun anzanui wuzeɠe dee laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">leemɔɔin ná-doun anzai wuzeɠe daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:6">ɛsɛ sili nui ɠa ɠɛ ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti.<verse eid="MIC 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu la GALA ná-maawɔinɠai la</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7"/>Nɔ̀un nà, nà wɛlɛzu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:7">nà ɠitosu nà-kizo GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:7">nà-GALAGI ɠa gòoɠaaʋote.<verse eid="MIC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8"/>Sìli nui, mina ɠoozunɛ nà-faa zu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">Mazɔlɔɔ ni nà loona, nà wuzeɠe ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">Ni nà zeini kpidii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:8">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa bɛ̀ ga wozakalagi.<verse eid="MIC 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9"/>Nà va Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawanai wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">tɔɔzei gè kotoi ɠɛɛni daalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">Kɛlɛ yeeta toɠa màalogi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">é ɠula ga ze, é tò wozakalagi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:9">nà ná-telebodai ma ɠɛɛwotii ɠa.<verse eid="MIC 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10"/>Toɠa ɠɛ sìli nuiti gaazu, unfegi lɔ ti ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">tɛiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu mà:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">«Mini ɠa deɠɛmu ɗa-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:10">Ta ti lɛɛvɛ ɠɔɠɔwu, eɠɛ taazuʋɛ ʋalaʋalagi, nà ti ʋɛtɛ!<verse eid="MIC 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11"/>Wɛlɛ, naama voloi ɠana ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:11">yeei wa-laa wolai ma ziɠigiti ti losu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:11">Wɛlɛ, naama volo ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:11">ta ɠa ɓɔ wa-yooi ʋa, kwɛmaʋɛti.<verse eid="MIC 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12"/>Naama volo ná, nuiti ta ʋa è ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">ti zeɠe Asiili yooi zu, ti zeɠe Ezipete yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">ti zeɠe ziɛ wolai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">ti zeɠe kpoloɗɛi ma ná pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:12">ti zeɠe gizeiti ma.<verse eid="MIC 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13"/>Zooi mɔta zu ɠa wo, gaa nuiti maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:13">naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ta-ɠɛɛwoti ɲɔiti ma zalai.<verse eid="MIC 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14"/>Lo ɗa-nuɓusɛiti untuɠɔ ga ɗa-lukpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">baala kpulugiti be ti ga ɗɔnɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">ti ya ɠila be ti zeini dɔɓɔi zu, Kaalamɛle gizei ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">Ti zoo ti laami Ɓasan lufa lɛnugiti su, ta Galaade gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:14">eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni la, mɔungi ma voloiti su!<verse eid="MIC 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15"/>Eɠɛ foloi è gi ɠulani la Ezipete yooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:15">laavɔɔ vaiti kɛ gi ʋɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16"/>Zii ɠiligiti ta ti ʋɛtɛ, ti wola unfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:16">anɛɛ zobogi pɛ ka ti ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:16">Ta yeeʋɛɛ la, ti laavɔɔ vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:16">ti-woizuʋɛti ta ɓɔlɔ.<verse eid="MIC 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17"/>Ta fufiligi ɠɔmɔ eɠɛ kaalii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">eɠɛ kpokpo aniiti ti zooi ɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">Ta ɠula ga duai ti-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">ti ʋa ga sasuɓalii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ, gá-ƓALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:17">ta lua ɗa-zobogi ʋa.<verse eid="MIC 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18"/>GALA, ɓɛ ɠa é ga è ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">a zoo é faaɠaaza golai ɓe, é tɔ koloɠologi zuvaayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">ɗa-nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti bɛ, ti ga ɗa-nuiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">Ɗɛi è la ɗa ga yɛ ziiɠaawanai zu eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:18">mazɔlɔɔ è-yiimai ɠa ga è wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19"/>Ɗa gi maawɔinɠaazu mɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">è la gá-vaaɠaaza golaiti pɛtɛga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:19">ɗa gá-ɠotoiti kpein pili ya kpoloɗɛi ma ʋalii zu.<verse eid="MIC 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20"/>Ungo, ɗa ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠula kɛlɛma Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:20">È è-zaalai ɠula kɛlɛma Abalaame mavofodaiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MIC 7:20">eɠɛʋelei è ma minazeɠegi woni da kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔi gi-mɛmɛwolani bɛ.<verse eid="MIC 7:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7"/>
</usx>
